        <section>
          <h2>Booking rules</h2>
          <p>
            A table is booked by the waiter or by the manager. The customer
            gets the table for up to two hours at busy times.
          </p>

          <div class="note">
            <strong>Tip:</strong> seat groups of four or more in the main hall
            or at the family tables, and keep the terrace for couples and small
            groups.
